    12	 * statement, lease renewal, the three completion/housekeeping writers. `idx_wakeups_one_inflight` now
    13	 * has an observable effect here — `claimNextWakeup` is the only writer of `claimed_at`, and it is the
    14	 * only writer this module has for that column; every other write of `lease_expires_at`/`completed_at`
